<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - India's VSNL starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - India's VSNL starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it had started coverage of Indian telephone company Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd, or VSNL, with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a Feb 5 report, analyst Manish Singhai set a 12-month price target of 1,197 rupees, representing a total return of 31.3 percent, including a dividend yield of 0.49 percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
